 "name_en": "Sales Processing Using Third-Party Without Shipping Notification (BDK)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Sales Processing Using Third-Party Without Shipping Notification (BDK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables you to automatically create a purchase requisition for the materials to be delivered by the third-party vendor. The incoming invoice from the vendor updates the billing quantity. You can only create the customer billing document after entering the invoice from the vendor.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create third-party sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Convert purchase requisition to purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter vendor invoice</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce stock and cost, increasing efficiency</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer customer requirements directly to external supplier</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Base invoice from trader to customer on quantities from supplier invoice</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Fulfill customer requirements despite material shortage</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>使用第三方的销售处理（不含装运通知）(BDK)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目使您能够为第三方供应商要交付的物料自动创建采购申请。来自供应商的采购发票将更新开票数量。您只能在输入供应商发票后创建客户开票凭证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建第三方销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将采购申请转换为采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">输入供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioe8f96cf4215748ed81abfbaabb083844__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">减少库存和成本，提高效率</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将客户需求直接传输给外部供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据供应商发票中的数量，确定从贸易商到客户的发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在物料短缺的情况下仍可满足客户需求</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "name_zh": "使用第三方的销售处理（不含装运通知）(BDK)",
